very quick response for any inquiries. really appreciate.","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5378821,"review":"Apartment was amazing , communication very easy \r\nbut small point bothering me that I have stayed more than 45 minutes to check in waiting hoster  to collect insurance fees although it was easier to provide me with lockbox passcode till representative arrived ","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5398339,"review":"Positive:\nNeat, clean and have a great location direct on the pool\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5412139,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5414260,"review":"Positive:\nEverything was so clean. Check in was so easy as well as finding the place.\n\nNegative:\nThe road to the compound is not the best","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5424428,"review":"The Place is Clean cozy , calm and clean and near from the downtown. Same as described in their listing. \nXuru team is helpful and always there for any help needed.\nWe will visit it again and will recommend it to my friends.","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5480420,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5482605,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5530246,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5546956,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5574995,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5576595,"review":"Positive:\nIt was clean and situated nicely inside gcribs in front of the pool.\nThe staff at Xuru Stays are super!\n\nNegative:\nAmenities inside the apartment could use some revamping. Gcribs itself is in the middle of nowhere","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5609142,"review":"Positive:\nI really appreciated the support I received from Marina at Xuru Agency. She was incredibly helpful and responsive, answering all my questions and handling my requests at any time.\n\nNegative:\nthe experience was quite disappointing. First, the location was difficult to access due to a reroute that we were never informed about prior to our travel. This made it very inconvenient to reach the property, and once we arrived, we found that getting transportation within Gouna was a real challenge—none of the local services were willing to accommodate our requests.\r\n\r\nTo make matters worse, the studio was not clean when we arrived. We had to clean it ourselves just to make it livable, which was not what we expected after a long trip.","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5631919,"review":"Positive:\nAll good\n\nNegative:\nOnly location is very far","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5670009,"review":"Positive:\nPerfect managment\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5736423,"review":"Positive:\nПеребування у цьому помешканні було приємним.\nФотографії відповідають дійсності. \nВеликий плюс, що є своя зона відпочинку і басейн знаходиться у декількох кроках від апартаментів. \nПерсонал дружелюбний і намагаються швидко вирішити всі питання. \n\nЗона басейну не супер доглянута, але це питання до компаунду, а не до власників апартаментів. \nТакож, непогано було б мати раптор від комарів та мух у приміщенні. \nЛокація знаходиться не близько до центру, але якщо ви подорожуєте машиною це не буде проблемою. Також, без проблем викликалися служби таксі, такі як Індрайвер та Убер, але потрібно почекати близько 7-10 хвилин поки вони доїдуть.\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5747032,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5773509,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5774151,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5783848,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5786856,"review":"Positive:\nممتاز جدا جدا\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5788524,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":197511,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5804543,"revie